Steps:
Step 1 — Log in normally

Use the Burp Chromium browser and log in with your Juice Shop account.

Keep:

Proxy → Intercept = OFF

Step 2 — Add a product to your basket

In Juice Shop:

1.	Pick any product. 

2.	Add it to your basket. 

3.	Open the basket. 

Now go to:

Burp → Proxy → HTTP history

Look through the requests generated when you opened the basket.

Then Refer the remaining steps on the BOLA report.
